# danse.roles - danse fills every role with its own colour of the same name.
#
# Roles are the slots the tool templates in templates/ are written in. They
# are danse's colour names because every template began life as a danse
# theme. This identity map is what makes danse render byte-for-byte as it
# did before the templates existed. Format: role|colour name in danse.conf.

bg|bg
bg-dark|bg-dark
surface|surface
fg|fg
comment|comment
blue|blue
cyan|cyan
green|green
yellow|yellow
magenta|magenta
vermilion|vermilion
terracotta|terracotta
ultramarine|ultramarine
viridian|viridian
diff-add|diff-add
diff-del|diff-del
